{
  "_comment": [
    "40 labelled queries for the port eval. `expect` is the domain a correct hit@3 must carry:",
    "the page a person asking this would want. It is deliberately one domain per query and not a",
    "list of acceptable answers, because a labelled set whose labels can be negotiated measures",
    "nothing. Where two real answers exist (a repo and its docs) the label names the canonical one.",
    "Every query was picked to be answerable by the keyless web path alone, so the two",
    "implementations are compared on the same route."
  ],
